      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I see it in the same way that a vrc+ user can choose a theme for the menu. \n\nSo it wouldn't be a particular color, but rather a theme, that VRChat would generate.\n\nBy the way, there's a color exception for VRChat admin users, their nametag is red instead of the default grey ;)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
