  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-04-07T00:11:11.522Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Since vrchat removed nametag colors for ranks, the new tags look way better but definitely a bit bland, maybe instead of trust based colors, let players choose a preset color for their nametag to add a bit more flare?\n\nIt's not that important but its always bothered me how bland the new tags look a bit, I used to use colored tags to match my avatar, so it would be interesting to have colors return but selectable.",
